############################################################
# TASK 2 — CHAT TRANSCRIPT STORAGE
############################################################

### SAVE CUSTOMER MESSAGE
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "customer-1-admin",
  "sender": "customer",
  "message": "Hello, is the Toyota Land Cruiser still available?"
}


### SAVE ADMIN MESSAGE
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "customer-1-admin",
  "sender": "admin",
  "message": "Yes, it is currently available."
}


### FETCH PREVIOUS CONVERSATION
GET http://localhost:5000/api/chat/conversations/customer-1-admin/messages